# NuvexaDB version bump

When bumping NuvexaDB, work in the `NuvexaDB/` submodule.

1. Set `<Version>` and `<PackageVersion>` to the same value in `NuvexaDB/Directory.Build.props`.
2. Run `python3 NuvexaDB/.github/scripts/check-versions.py --repo-root NuvexaDB --write`
3. Confirm the checker is all OK. Then commit in NuvexaDB and ask about a GitHub Release.

`--write` covers README `**Version:**`, VS Code, Visual Studio, Data Studio `app.manifest`, and all language bindings. .NET engine / Tools / CLI / Native / Explorer inherit `Directory.Build.props`. Do not set a second Version in those csprojs. Do not bump sample apps.
